#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>This is the list of defined filters. They are processed "
"top-to-bottom.</p>"
"<p>Click on any filter to edit it using the controls in the right-hand half "
"of the dialog.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Hierdie is die lys van gedefinieër filters. Hulle word geprosesseer "
"top-na-bottom.</p>"
"<p>Kliek op enige filter na redigeer dit te gebruik die kontroles in die "
"right-hand half van die dialoog.</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:45
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Click this button to create a new filter.</p>"
"<p>The filter will be inserted just before the currently selected one, but "
"you can always change that later on.</p>"
"<p>If you have clicked this button accidentally, you can undo this by "
"clicking on the <em>Delete</em> button (to the right).</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Kliek hierdie knoppie na skep 'n nuwe filter.</p>"
"<p>Die filter sal wees ingesit net voor Die huidiglik gekose een, maar jy "
"kan altyd verander wat later op.</p>"
"<p>As jy het gekliek het hierdie knoppie perongeluk, jy kan herstel hierdie "
"deur te kliek op Die <em>Uitvee</em> knoppie (na Die regterkant).</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:52
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Click this button to <em>delete</em> the currently selected filter from "
"the list above.</p>"
"<p>There is no way to get the filter back once it is deleted, but you can "
"always leave the dialog by clicking <em>Cancel</em> to discard the changes "
"made.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Kliek hierdie knoppie na <em>uitvee</em> die huidiglik gekose filter van "
"die lys boonste.</p>"
"<p>Daar is nee weg na kry die filter terug as eers dit is uitgevee, maar jy "
"kan altyd los die dialoog deur te kliek <em>Kanseleer</em> na gooi weg die "
"verander gemaak.</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Click this button to move the currently selected filter <em>up</em> one "
"in the list above.</p>"
"<p>This is useful since the order of the filters in the list determines the "
"order in which they are tried on messages: The topmost filter gets tried "
"first.</p>"
"<p>If you have clicked this button accidentally, you can undo this by "
"clicking on the <em>down</em> button (to the right).</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Kliek hierdie knoppie na beweeg die huidiglik gekose filter "
"<em>begin</em> een in die lys boonste.</p>"
"<p>hierdie is bruikbare sedert die volgorde van die filters in die lys "
"bepaal die volgorde in wat hulle word probeer op boodskappe: die hoogste "
"filter besit probeer eerste.</p>"
"<p>As jy het gekliek het hierdie knoppie perongeluk, jy kan herstel hierdie "
"deur te kliek op die <em>ondertoe</em> knoppie (na die regterkant).</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:67
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Click this button to move the currently selected filter <em>down</em>"
" one in the list above.</p>"
"<p>This is useful since the order of the filters in the list determines the "
"order in which they are tried on messages: The topmost filter gets tried "
"first.</p>"
"<p>If you have clicked this button accidentally, you can undo this by "
"clicking on the <em>up</em> button (to the left)</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Kliek hierdie knoppie na beweeg die huidiglik gekose filter "
"<em>ondertoe</em> een in die lys boonste.</p>"
"<p>hierdie is bruikbare sedert die volgorde van die filters in die lys "
"bepaal die volgorde in wat hulle word probeer op boodskappe: die hoogste "
"filter besit probeer eerste.</p>"
"<p>As jy het gekliek het hierdie knoppie perongeluk, jy kan herstel hierdie "
"deur te kliek op die <em>begin</em> knoppie (na die links)</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Click this button to rename the currently selected filter.</p>"
"<p>Filters are named automatically, as long as they start with "
"\"<<\".</p>"
"<p>"
"If you have renamed a filter accidentally and want automatic naming back, "
"click this button and select <em>Clear</em> followed by <em>OK</em> in the "
"appearing dialog.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Kliek hierdie knoppie na herbenaam die huidiglik gekose "
"filter.</p>"
"<p>Filters word genaamd automaties, as lang as hulle begin met "
"\"<<\".</p>"
"<p>As jy het herbenaam 'n filter perongeluk en wil hê automaties benaming "
"terug, Kliek hierdie knoppie en kies <em>Maak skoon</em> volg deur "
"<em>Goed</em> in die verskyning dialoog.</p></qt>"

#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:82
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Check this button to force the confirmation dialog to show up.</p>"
"<p>This is useful if you have defined a ruleset that tags messages to be "
"downloaded later. Without the possibility to force the dialog popup, these "
"messages could never be downloaded if no other large messages were waiting "
"on the server, or if you wanted to change the ruleset to tag the messages "
"differently.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Bevestig hierdie knoppie na forseer die bevestiging dialoog na vertoon "
"begin.</p>"
"<p>hierdie is bruikbare as jy het gedefinieër 'n reëlstel wat etiket "
"boodskappe na wees afgelaai later. Sonder om te die moontlikheid na forseer "
"die dialoog opspring, hierdie boodskappe kon moet nooit wees afgelaai as nee "
"ander groot boodskappe was terwyl gewag het op die bediener, of as jy wil "
"hê na verander die reëlstel na etiket die boodskappe verskillend.</p></qt>"

