msgid "New entry:"
msgstr "Nuwe inskrywing:"

#: simplestringlisteditor.cpp:66
msgid "&Add..."
msgstr "Voeg by..."

#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can use the Left/Right keys of your keyboard to go to\n"
"the previous/next message?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan gebruik die Links/Regterkant sleutels van jou sleutelbord "
"na gaan na\n"
"die vorige/volgende boodskap?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"<p>...that you can rapidly create filters on sender, recipient,\n"
"subject and mailing lists with <em>Tools->Create&nbsp;Filter</em>?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<p>...wat jy kan vinnig skep filters op stuurder, ontvanger,\n"
"onderwerp en pos lyste met <em>Tools->Createnbsp;Filter</em>?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:14
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can get rid of the &quot;[mailing list name]&quot;\n"
"added to the subject of some mailing lists by using the <em>rewrite\n"
"header</em> filter action? Just use\n"
"<pre>rewrite header &quot;Subject&quot;\n"
"   replace &quot;\\s*\\[mailing list name\\]\\s*&quot;\n"
"   with &quot;&quot;</pre>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan kry ontslae van die &quot;[pos lys naam]&quot;\n"
"bygevoeg na die onderwerp van sommige pos lyste deur te gebruik die "
"<em>herskryf\n"
"opskrif</em> filter aksie? Net gebruik\n"
"<pre>herskryf opskrif &quot;Subjectquot;\n"
"   vervang &quot;\\s*\\[pos lys naam\\]\\s*&quot;\n"
"   met &quot;&quot;</pre>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:24
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can associate mailing lists with folders in the\n"
"<em>Folder->Properties...</em> dialog? You can then use\n"
"<em>Message->Post to Mailing List...</em> to open the composer with\n"
"the mailing list address preset.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan assosieer pos lyste met gidse in die\n"
"<em>Folder->Properties...</em> dialoog? jy kan dan word gebruik\n"
"<em>Message->Post na pos Lys...</em> na open die saamsteller met\n"
"die pos Lys adres vooraf stel.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:31
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can assign custom icons to each folder individually?\n"
"See <em>Folder->Properties...</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan toeken pasmaak ikoone na elke kabinet individueel?\n"
"Sien <em>kabinet->Properties...</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:36
msgid ""
"<p>...that KMail can show a color bar indicating the type of message\n"
"(Plain text/HTML/OpenPGP) currently displayed?</p>\n"
"<p>This thwarts attempts to fake successful signature verification by\n"
"sending HTML mails mimicking KMail's signature status frames.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can filter on any header by simply entering its name\n"
"in the first edit field of a search rule?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan filter op enige opskrif deur eenvoudig in te tik sy naam\n"
"in die eerste redigeer veld van 'n soektog reël?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:48
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can filter out HTML only messages with the rule\n"
"<pre>&quot;Content-type&quot; contains &quot;text/html&quot;?</pre>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan filter uit html slegs boodskappe met die reël\n"
"<pre>&quot;Content-typequot; bevat &quot;teks/htmlquot;?</pre>\n"
"</p>\n"

